  "title": {
   "en": "Kokoro Himeru no Zen Himitsu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "古々路ひめるの全秘密"
   },
   {
    "en": "Everything About Himeru Kokoro"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Tsugumu Ichimonji, a world-renowned high school bodyguard, transfers to a Japanese high school to secretly guard Himeru Kokoro, the daughter of a wealthy man. One day, he chases her to the rooftop and witnesses Himeru, a huge dragon and a flame all around her!! \"Don't worry... I'm immune to fire!\" Himeru Kokoro is the reincarnation of a hero from another world. If the secret is leaked, the world will be in danger! Tsugumu Ichimonji vows to protect her secret, but there is not just one secret he needs to protect. On the contrary... Her secret inevitably opens the door to the extraordinary.",
   "ja": "世界的用心棒高校生・一文字ツグムは、大富豪の娘・古々路ひめるの秘密警護のため、日本の高校に転校。ある日、屋上に向かう彼女を追いかけ目撃したのは、ひめると一面の炎と巨大なドラゴン!!\n\n「大丈夫…あたし、火属性無効だから！」\n\n古々路ひめるは異世界の勇者の転生体だったのだ。秘密が漏れると世界が危ない！一文字ツグムは彼女の秘密を守ることを誓うが、守るべき彼女の秘密はひとつだけではなく、それどころか…。彼女の秘密が否応なく非日常の扉を開く。"
  },
